\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Here is the new vision for the product:\uc0\u8232 	A travel partner application for solo, couple or group travellers. This application will be useful in splitting bills and maintaining travel log of spends and documents (Ex: bills, receipts, tickets etc)\
Name of the application: \
	Roamio\
Tagline: \
	Split bills. Not Friendships\
Sub-tagline: \
	Instant peer splits. Zero Awkward  Math.\
Use cases -\uc0\u8232 	Users will need to log in to the application, using single sign-on via their Gmail/Apple ID or will create the account via email and password. \
	A new user (Example: \'91User A\'92) who wants to start an adventure:\
		Once a \'91User A\'92 is logged in, the user will see the existing adventures. If their are no adventures present, then a user can click on a button called \'91New Adventure\'92\
		\'91User A\'92 will add a description for the new adventure: Example - name of the place to be visited (Country, city etc). Will add a text for the Adventure (Example: College group\'92s Bangkok adventure)\
		\'91User A\'92 will now be asked to either add the squad (new users), a sharable link will be generated. The user will be able to copy this link and share it with their squad on other existing messaging apps. NOTE: These users will need to have the application pre installed and a logged in.\
		This user (User A) will become the \'91Squad Leader\'92 as this is the user who initiated the adventure.\
	A new user (Example \'91User B\'92) who has received an invite via a link to join an adventure from \'91User A\'92:\
		\'91User B\'92 receives a link to join adventure <Adventure name>, \'91User B\'92 will click on the link --> install the app \'97> open the app \'97> create an account  and  view all the awaiting adventures they need to be a part of.\
		\'91User B\'92 will click on the adventure from the list and will now be a part of the respective adventure\'92s squad.\
	Creating a new co-squad leader:\
		Since \'91User A\'92 was the squad leader \
		User A will see a Squad member has been added to the squad \
		User A will be able to either be \'91kick out\'92 (remove) or assign this user as a \'91co-squad lead\'92\
	Creating a pseudo user / pal:\
		A squad leader or a co-squad lead can create a pseudo user called \'91pal\'92 \
		A pal is a user who presents with the user during their adventures but the user does not have access to the application.\
		A pal will always be dependent on users who have access to the application.\
	Add an adventure:\
		\outl0\strokewidth0 Any user with access to the application can create an adventure\
		Each user who is a part of the squad can add their personal budget to the adventure - a user\'92s personal budget will be hidden from other users.\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \
	Adding a tab:\
		Any user (except a pal- as they do not have access to the app) will be able to create a tab \
	Splits:\
		Any user can view the latest split report which would be linked to the adventure \
	Alert / Notification \
		Alert user when their personal budget limit has been reached\
\
	What all data will be accessed from the internet:\
		The banner of the adventure will be downloaded from the Internet and loaded as default based on the country selected - fetch from the internet, compress and upload. Ensure this is cached and loaded instantly.\
		The default local currency will be fetched based on the country selected.\
		Weather for users location \
	Data in a user profile:\
		Upload user personal photo via Camera or phone gallery \
		User name (fetch from gmail) editable \
		User description (optional)\
		\
	Data in adventure details:\
		Country name \
		Start date and end date \
		Auto download banner photo (based on country selected)\
			User can edit the banner photo by uploading their own photo via camera or phone gallery (Optional)\
		Auto populate (editable) currency details \
		Adventure description (Optional) \
	Data in expense \'91Tab\'92:\
		Click picture to fetch bill details (OCR) - auto populate relevant fields (Optional)\
		Tab description (Optional)\
		Tab amount \
		Tab currency (Default to the default currency for the adventure)\
		Tab date (auto populate the current date but must be editable by the user)\
		Select users from the squad who are a part of the tab (Allow multi-select)\
		Add pseudo user (for the tab) (Optional)\
		Add 4 memories to the tab (Upload via camera / phone gallery) (Optional)\
		Fetch users location and save location details (Optional)\
	Rights of a squad lead / co-squad lead:\
		Add / Edit adventure\'92s metadata- Name, duration, default picture, adding/ removing users (including pseudo users).\
	Access:\
		Online and offline \
		Offline:\
			Sync once user clicks on a button to sync \
			text below the button \'93We know the data might be of essence, click here to sync the adventure with your squad\'94\
	Currency conversion:\
		User will be able to add expanse in any currency they want but will be able to see the settlement in the currency which is set up as default in their profile.\
		Use an existing API for currency conversation \
Application screens:\
